### Add a book
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Dune", "author": "Frank Herbert" }

### Get all books
GET http://localhost:3000/books

### Get one book
GET http://localhost:3000/books/1

### Full update (title + author + status)
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Dune", "author": "Frank Herbert", "status": "reading" }

### Update status only (for the dropdown)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/books/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "finished...good book!" }

### Delete a book
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/1

### Get books filtered by status
GET http://localhost:3000/books?status=reading

### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@example.com", "password": "password123" }

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@example.com", "password": "password123" }

### Login with wrong password (should return 401)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@example.com", "password": "wrongpass" }

### Register duplicate email (should return 409)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@example.com", "password": "password123" }